      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24794c9372059fe4c811fbd57b999120, type: 3}
    - Dialogue: No,
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69bff71eeb1dc104a8e5e86b81320fe1, type: 3}
    - Dialogue: The only FAULT I made is GIVING you that damn phone to begin with!
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24794c9372059fe4c811fbd57b999120, type: 3}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Do you understand that you working so much leaves you with no
